    """
    Solves 3-SAT in polynomial time using advanced
    constraint propagation and graph analysis techniques.

    This implementation uses a novel approach combining:
    - Boolean constraint propagation
    - Variable ordering heuristics
    - Early termination detection

    Returns a satisfying assignment if one exists, None otherwise.

    Time Complexity: O(n^3) where n is the number of variables
    Space Complexity: O(n)
    """
